  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_09",
  "title": "Out of the Jungle",
  "storyCode": "RI-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5549b0bb838c4be93ffa69192b3c5dec406faffc3b40e882a5d4d83f68008472",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Tomimi, are you okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "I won't let you leave!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Huh? Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "B-because I don't want to be without you again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "I wanted to become Great Chief so I could force you to stay...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Does that mean you're the one who organized the ceremony this time?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "Yes. If you didn't show up in the middle of it, I'd have become the Great Chief.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "...I see.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Huh? What are you guys talking about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It was very odd to have the ceremony at all.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hm? What are you talking about, Doctor? What's that about the ceremony?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "You're pretty smart, outsider.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Just think about it for a minute, Gavial.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Ever since you left, most of the tribes dissolved into the many smaller tribes we know today. Without a central leader, the tribes couldn't come together to do anything at all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "So how could we suddenly put on a ceremony? There had to be someone organizing things behind the scenes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hm? Wasn't it you who organized the ceremony?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "It wasn't me. The Big Ugly still needed an engine. It wasn't done. I was planning to wait another year before contacting the other tribes to hold the ceremony, but then, all of a sudden, it was happening.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "It was unexpected, but I didn't mind. I thought that, even an incomplete Big Ugly could have shocked the world.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "The unexpected part was you coming back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Now that you mention it, Tomimi was the one who asked me to return.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "So you really did orchestrate everything.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "...Yes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "I've been studying for years to learn what I would need to convince the other tribes to make me the Great Chief.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "But, it's not too late...The tribes under my command are waiting out there, and the Big Ugly has been defeated. No one can stop me from making Gavial stay!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Why do you want me here so badly?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "B-Because...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "W-Where am I...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Waahh... aahhh... I want to go home...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Agh!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Hey, Tomimi. Are you okay?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "You're such a pain. I let you out of my sight for one second and you run off to a place like this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial, you're bleeding!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Huh? It's fine, it's just a little cut.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Come on, let's go home.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial saved my life! I love her more than anyone!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "A-And, Gavial is the strongest. As long as Gavial is our Great Chief, she can lead everyone!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Here I was thinking that you're all grown up now, but you haven't changed a bit...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "I've got important work to do, Tomimi. You can't stop me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "...The books said: 'If I can't capture his heart, then I'll keep him close to me.' The books also said: 'As long as he is by my side, it doesn't matter if he hates me.'",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "S-So, even if you hate me, Gavial, I still want you here!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Whew... She's been slurping down trashy romance novels with a straw...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Now the Big Ugly is down, and you're exhausted. You can't beat me!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "If you surrender, I-I won't hurt you!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "You can't keep me here, Tomimi.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "...T-That's not up to you!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Everyone, attack!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
